@MetadataApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Liveness (process health only; no database checks yet)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: text/plain

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Create an application
# @name createApplication
POST {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inventory Portal",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "company": "Example Company",
  "website": "https://inventory.example.com",
  "source": "https://github.com/example/inventory",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "description": "Tracks inventory across warehouses."
}

### Read the application created above (REST Client response variable)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing application: 404 Problem Details
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Accept: application/json

### Invalid application ID: 400 validation Problem Details
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json

### Invalid metadata: 400 with field-keyed errors
POST {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "version": "v1",
  "website": "ftp://example.com"
}
